{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e940f8ee3eb6003a9b10ba5d65136e253533f2fc49deea9ff09acffcef6a20e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2620b13db0d0dd9dcd4e7f3bf2832af3124e81813014fe3f98f4bad86fa0370c",
      "text": "憧憬的偶像",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bc767cb747f53972ce64d087382b7117b9ad4cae5aa6434eb71e1300e76ee36",
      "text": "第一次打招呼时因受到冬马的亲切对待，\n花音成了他的粉丝。听说接到了和冬马\n一起的工作，花音干劲十足。\n但是在练习中却很难碰面，\n于是花音采取了某个行动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2620b13db0d0dd9dcd4e7f3bf2832af3124e81813014fe3f98f4bad86fa0370c",
      "text": "憧憬的偶像",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:648284ee4d1f961776401431265bfd5d8c3aff083b3341ec9a95c4c758e439e0",
      "text": "花音君，下一份工作定下来了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3589e88360af99f802f7e93c69a1fada9591226ec36f5dcc20529d633cafcf",
      "text": "哇，接下来是什么样的工作？\n要是可爱的工作就太好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb9b3e9a9bd6f7aa34efb4dab9be018702102214652436d4b28537046108c8a",
      "text": "虽然不是可爱的工作，\n但这次是和冬马先生一起的工作哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebacdfbec5ca000e25b2a35d5e850f533d73f7be63bebdb0201a6ec62c02aad3",
      "text": "跟、跟冬马君一起！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d456474125f044232071f5a6a07a51eeb2bc92ddea74d14780897dcbbf1806f4",
      "text": "是的，没错哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f704e957261810d2b2da58538f44393f07dab75a0ec805660658c16e17932579",
      "text": "怎、怎么办才好……！！\n花音超——级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cec1944b6a14dcfb56a4e72df67cfd40533640b0da5d76fdddc936da8b1e7803",
      "text": "那个呢，花音是冬马君的粉丝哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f26b5d9d8c6d8dfe598ea472a8b3ca5c9089153bf7b67bd68999e8627b926905",
      "text": "在事务所第一次打招呼的时候，他对我超级\n温柔的。从那之后我就变成粉丝了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f58a1fcb2b1f577f22f0bea789e79ce672ac7daacb29a41219cd899a7b26873",
      "text": "能一起工作真让人期待呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2392e0cddb328c893f17d98721cf80c81b55affbf5b5de8d07bb617690527536",
      "text": "嗯！花音要为了和冬马君的\n工作超——级努力才行～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c8dac87125bd1fddd42ba6a91f4591f52bb71544d9f0f1f15210b1fd6a4cd9",
      "text": "呐，●●●●プロデューサー。\n和冬马君的练习是什么时候？有几次呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edd4f3139d2a564b822d14a4935085119cb26a7cb9820156f5ecd35420b587f",
      "text": "关于那件事，因为双方日程安排的关系，\n能够一起练习的机会只有一次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e032fb829532e8fed0fb1e52ac6a9e2cbf7658372c884163f7125bafcedcc672",
      "text": "哎，这样啊……明明以为能一起做很多次\n练习的说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eec3abc63050c76eb87c80a043b0de2cfe4eb9a61bd95c96b91b2966910caef",
      "text": "能一起练习绝对是最好的，\n看看能不能想办法调整，我再去确认一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e049bc777a7036ea503caacb234c89e8e77429008d93e7a3a7c22411b74de62b",
      "text": "不用啦，没关系的！就算只有一次能和冬马君\n一起练习！花音就很开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:901f15e982375ccdf20e555d364a78c5a94756661144e512a6fe7170cb544500",
      "text": "而且呢，听说冬马君一次都不落下\n一直在坚持自主练习呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88a9066e2a1cde59e1e5b0d18b2228fc85742ce719fa47f2fd93a890795a0ea",
      "text": "花音也要像冬马君一样\n努力自主练习！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e74eda870e08342ef2bb9a812cab8976d57fe13fc1b87acaa0a21b11096ee99",
      "text": "因为在和冬马君一起练习的时候，\n想要被他觉得好厉害嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d72a7f369804b4618d2e1de85d2ec5f27299443c0b3e840684503a91106ad9",
      "text": "而且要是那个冬马君觉得花音很厉害的话，\n工作也会大获成功的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd113611a41a3b0a0b3edd2261f88c4dc000efd6d990cbf2b5a82331e1625174",
      "text": "所以，●●●●プロデューサー也\n敬请期待哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7675aa045aa8acf74b318fc6466256ff02c71d994459bf995cdf2ad626e39560",
      "text": "（咦？花音君的妈妈打来的电话……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9b3e77fbd49ac8167cca9a43348caa946c6033f20a37fddb4eae865d7c5544d",
      "text": "制作人，承蒙关照了。那个，\n我听花音说练习延长了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4117ee820ea8aa46ffcccd6efdbacaf0a4eaf4390d5a063026903351fe8349c",
      "text": "能告诉我大概几点结束吗？\n那孩子没记住结束的时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e502bd3e8052c8ed1c81697f2b6e0e73cae74eeceec4bbe2677ec9b2456bf32",
      "text": "（练习应该早就结束了才对……\n啊，说起来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f84f15d388586ff70c4eeae994e70404dccba08bce3659e78c6ecd7f9e272cb0",
      "text": "（今天我跟花音君说过冬马先生可能会来事务所。\n难道说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:133fe04af6b383fcee5af6ae9eb94f3b83dc3c7ee607334fc8fee2f41a6ca830",
      "text": "好的，马上就结束了。\n我会负责将他送回家的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4b0a9251c1bfa363673927ea0dacb9ccdabd23cd48f8852f580f718efa0270f",
      "text": "（在事务所里能藏身又不起眼的地方。\n……是仓库！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:338d8b0c4d9c5488780a278c69eb969060baf144dd057dd0311563b3c786fc27",
      "text": "果然。\n你果然在这里呢，花音君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:882f5cfca5aa4d5c88cd7ff7ab38202019043702c146d9e5884edc49701eb5be",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a9795b0c6f1bea5ca18ab26972934ad523b83c26d3731b25f11ce579e0e5ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n怎么知道花音在这里的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d11f184e9b5b567e665e97d502110b699d2a44df8e5a4149c9e522900b9771b6",
      "text": "因为花音君的妈妈打电话来，\n问我练习几点结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03bb95acae0df81b2301cead8dba39c42f78167cbf1496c91eba46bd27df9407",
      "text": "我想着如果要藏起来的话就是这个地方了，过来一看，\n花音君果然在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bd666a25a3dbad8748f31bf482b930fb6256aa780326d2c06a4d5dc5024c78e",
      "text": "这样啊……●●●●プロデューサー\n什么都能猜到花音在想什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e106df84580591187ff3916efe1c3c4467b49f7d4cb63793f9c5c3fd849fced",
      "text": "花音君……能够沉浸在喜欢的事情里，\n我认为是非常美好的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eccc02d9ffff94ed66c23ecfff6db21bf62555bd96e1406707baa4f734af62af",
      "text": "但是，撒谎是不对的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53f099b7344da657842434823722a9a9520afe24337aeaa049306a62ca042d1",
      "text": "对不起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1f666cef43dec224e2911529b44021aa6ee85879c8ac6d74b22b9f2b7b7bbab",
      "text": "花音只是想快点让冬马君看到\n我跳得很好的样子嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e66b83eae9f6fa628ea52b824e7c5ec96492262114df7beeee3666ce26d624",
      "text": "怎么办……花音对妈妈撒谎了。\n回不了家了啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fde35a2599ddf82dca1ee2fbff41d67af9026f9fca0ca1af5b3204c474ec8f97",
      "text": "我也向花音君的妈妈撒了谎，说还在练习。\n……我们一起去道歉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06beb6a2f8bd79f4587f017f860376605137fb5771bfd195fcd86c354ea6b1f3",
      "text": "嗯……\n花音会好好向妈妈说对不起的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d824dda35b02e4e96e5406e7dfa45159950de58ec628266d67347065e0b3fd19",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be1fcc4b7d9b35ff39775275c82a6de62d0bd24216019f4bd9c7f95421ce67c7",
      "text": "和冬马君的练习结束了，\n我来向你汇报啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c34bfc2fa78e2391f1d8eb78a91d0e07108a110745bdf3254018ea94fe3ec9",
      "text": "辛苦了，花音君。\n谢谢你来汇报！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bf21af3e525c403fb0cc96761872d206e54e1ed5d7a34cf1600132227514db2",
      "text": "嗯！冬马君也拜托我向你汇报呢。\n他还说“工作要加油去干啦！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ff0faeaee6613fbde43ff5f9f758747b27f6065e57da4ca0a17e85c17bf2809",
      "text": "今天的练习怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de223abfb5fd596eaa506443b05e7d8789f7a385d31565af209d7f1fc647e2c",
      "text": "练习的时候，冬马君看着花音夸我\n“跳得超级棒嘛！”了哦！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:571ded4e2416a43ee8c98e74b213e83ebb62de473904dd40875adb2bff9ec1df",
      "text": "花音君的努力传达给冬马先生了，\n太好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e455736d790e89e20db96e8fe9c8a1e05b67f7b5fe06e3d250ee11bbb534d60e",
      "text": "嗯♪不过呢，今天的练习跳得很好，\n所以也很想让●●●●プロデューサー看看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f9d75fab6c64352fbd8a5c9acd94c517387ecef501119f6e4a2fe5c76939c0",
      "text": "花音想要被觉得很厉害的，\n不仅是冬马君，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:577a70be8b6ed2e6af2c5a6fc449ec3f4fae3cbd470e81acadcdc06a8ae9cc57",
      "text": "还有●●●●プロデューサー也是哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5bca3efc2953cb616b72e5f2ca82b5be6d63149c49b66f1e6a0b8b39a76c59f",
      "text": "那么，在正式演出时请向我展示花音君很多厉害的地方吧。\n我很期待哦……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8371529ae19ca32b2729b959e7a3fe26daa35f7c5063c48ccd6957f02ecb2c0",
      "text": "嗯！\n我会变得比今天更厉害的，敬请期待哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
